MeedyaDL Brand Assets — Proprietary, All Rights Reserved
==========================================================

Everything in this folder (assets/brand/) is NOT covered by MeedyaDL's
MIT licence. That includes the MeedyaDL name, logo, wordmark, and every
icon, image, or design file here (SVG sources, rendered PNG/ICO/ICNS
icons, favicons, and the brand kit page).

Copyright (c) 2024-2026 MeedyaSuite. All rights reserved.

These files may not be copied, modified, or reused outside of the
MeedyaDL project without written permission from MeedyaSuite — even
though the rest of the MeedyaDL codebase is open source under the MIT
Licence (see the LICENSE file at the root of this repository). The
application's code and its brand identity are covered by different
terms; this file is what tells you that when this folder is copied on
its own, since a raster image (PNG/ICO/ICNS) can't carry a header
comment the way a source file can.

For permission requests, open a discussion at
<https://github.com/MWBMPartners/MeedyaDL/discussions> or contact the
maintainers via the email listed on the GitHub organisation profile.
